---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
import SyncCliRecording from '../components/SyncCliRecording.astro';
import SyncCollabDemo from '../components/SyncCollabDemo.astro';
---

<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: 'RTMX Sync', template: 'splash', hero: { tagline: '' } }}>
  <div class="sync-page rtmx-splash" data-testid="sync-explainer">
    <div class="sync-shell">
      <section class="sync-hero">
        <p class="sync-kicker" data-testid="sync-kicker">
          <span class="sync-kicker-lead">What comes after</span>
          <span class="sync-kicker-rotator" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="sync-kicker-words">
              <span>Agile</span>
              <span>Kanban</span>
              <span>Issues</span>
              <span>Jira</span>
              <span>Asana</span>
              <span>Monday</span>
              <span>Agile</span>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="sync-kicker-sr">Agile</span>
        </p>
        <h1>RTMX Sync</h1>
        <p
          class="sync-api-host-note"
          id="sync-api-host-note"
          data-testid="sync-api-host-note"
          hidden
        >
          <code>sync.rtmx.ai</code> is the Sync API host for clients and agents —
          not a product page. You are on the right place for humans:
          start a trial or install the open source CLI below.
        </p>
        <p class="sync-lede">
          Git versioned the file. Sync is the room — a live matrix of intent where
          humans and agents claim work, converge, and ship without a ticket board
          in the middle.
        </p>
        <div class="sync-cta-row">
          <a href="/checkout" class="sync-cta primary" data-testid="sync-cta-checkout">Start 14-day free trial</a>
          <a href="/docs/installation" class="sync-cta secondary" data-testid="sync-cta-cli">Install the open source client</a>
        </div>
        <p class="sync-client-note" data-testid="sync-trial-note">
          Start Sync trial → install the free client → sign in to the room.
        </p>
      </section>
      <script>
        // Landed from sync.rtmx.ai HTML redirect (?from=api-host).
        if (new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('from') === 'api-host') {
          const note = document.getElementById('sync-api-host-note');
          if (note) note.hidden = false;
        }
      </script>

      <SyncCollabDemo />
      <SyncCliRecording />

      <section class="sync-section">
        <h2>Git stopped at the commit</h2>
        <p>
          Version control won because the artifact was the coordination surface.
          Agentic engineering broke that bargain: agents move faster than PRs,
          status lives in chat, and Jira becomes the second source of truth you
          keep in sync by hand.
        </p>
        <p>
          RTMX Sync is the next surface — a tenant-isolated room of requirements
          that converges live. Claims, status, and dependencies update while you
          work. No merge fight for “who owns REQ-042.”
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="sync-section">
        <h2>One room. Humans and any agent stack.</h2>
        <div class="sync-grid not-content">
          <article class="sync-point">
            <h3>Live matrix</h3>
            <p>Status, priority, and blockers update without refresh — the same view for operators, Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, and subagents.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="sync-point">
            <h3>Claimed work</h3>
            <p>Any client claims with identity. Conflicts resolve in the room, not in Slack — WIP is the project system.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="sync-point">
            <h3>Tenant isolation</h3>
            <p>Org-scoped rooms on managed Sync, self-managed, or air-gapped. Same protocol everywhere.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="sync-point">
            <h3>No board tax</h3>
            <p>Skip the SaaS kanban and the token-burning MCP glue that keeps a ticket system “synced.”</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sync-section sync-client">
        <h2>The client is open source</h2>
        <p>
          Install once, sign in, then join the room. Hosted Sync defaults to
          <code>sync.rtmx.ai</code> — no URL pasting. Self-hosted operators pass
          their host (the client adds <code>wss://</code> for you).
        </p>
        <pre class="sync-code" data-testid="sync-install"><code>brew install rtmx-ai/tap/rtmx
rtmx login
rtmx sync</code></pre>
        <p class="sync-selfhost-note">
          Self-hosted example:
          <code>rtmx sync --sync-url sync.example.com/sync/acme/main</code>
        </p>
        <p class="sync-client-links">
          <a href="/docs/installation">Installation docs</a>
          ·
          <a href="https://github.com/rtmx-ai/rtmx">GitHub</a>
          ·
          <a href="/pricing">Plans &amp; pricing</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="sync-section sync-close">
        <h2>Start in the room</h2>
        <p>
          Hosted Team Sync includes a 14-day free trial. Enterprise and air-gapped
          stay sales-assisted. The thesis does not wait on a price card.
        </p>
        <div class="sync-cta-row">
          <a href="/checkout" class="sync-cta primary">Start 14-day free trial</a>
          <a href="/docs/installation" class="sync-cta secondary">Install the client</a>
          <a href="/pricing" class="sync-cta tertiary">See plans</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</StarlightPage>

<style is:global>
  .sync-api-host-note {
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    max-width: 36rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(110, 231, 183, 0.35);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08);
    color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .sync-api-host-note[hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .sync-api-host-note code {
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .sync-page {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -10%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.14), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #12100e 45%, #0a0a0a 100%);
    min-height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    color: var(--rtmx-text, #e7e5e4);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .sync-page *,
  .sync-page *::before,
  .sync-page *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  /* Single content column — equal horizontal inset for every section */
  .sync-shell {
    --sync-pad-x: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    --sync-pad-y: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--sync-pad-y) var(--sync-pad-x) 4rem;
  }
  .sync-hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 0 var(--sync-pad-y);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .sync-kicker {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35em;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rtmx-emerald-light, #6ee7b7);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sync-kicker-sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  .sync-kicker-rotator {
    display: inline-block;
    height: 1.15em;
    overflow: hidden;
    vertical-align: baseline;
    text-align: left;
    min-width: 7.5ch;
  }
  .sync-kicker-words {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    animation: sync-kicker-spin 14s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) infinite;
  }
  .sync-kicker-words > span {
    display: block;
    height: 1.15em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  @keyframes sync-kicker-spin {
    /* 6 unique words + duplicate Agile for seamless loop; dwell then snap. */
    0%,
    12% {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    16.66%,
    28.66% {
      transform: translateY(-1.15em);
    }
    33.33%,
    45.33% {
      transform: translateY(-2.3em);
    }
    50%,
    62% {
      transform: translateY(-3.45em);
    }
    66.66%,
    78.66% {
      transform: translateY(-4.6em);
    }
    83.33%,
    95.33% {
      transform: translateY(-5.75em);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateY(-6.9em);
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .sync-kicker-words {
      animation: none;
    }
    .sync-kicker-words > span:not(:first-child) {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  .sync-hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #6ee7b7 55%, #a7f3d0 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .sync-lede {
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.2vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--rtmx-text-muted, #a8a29e);
  }
  .sync-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .sync-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .sync-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  /* White label on emerald — beat Starlight link color overrides */
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.primary,
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.primary:visited,
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.primary:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981);
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.secondary,
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.secondary:visited {
    border: 1px solid rgba(110, 231, 183, 0.35);
    color: #6ee7b7;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #6ee7b7;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.06);
  }
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.tertiary,
  .sync-page a.sync-cta.tertiary:visited {
    color: var(--rtmx-text-muted, #a8a29e);
    -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--rtmx-text-muted, #a8a29e);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    background: transparent;
  }
  .sync-client-note {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--rtmx-text-dim, #78716c);
  }
  .sync-client-note code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: #6ee7b7;
  }
  .sync-section {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--sync-pad-y) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(110, 231, 183, 0.1);
  }
  .sync-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--rtmx-text, #f5f5f4);
  }
  .sync-section > p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--rtmx-text-muted, #a8a29e);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }
  .sync-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .sync-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .sync-point {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 16, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(110, 231, 183, 0.22);
  }
  .sync-point h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #f5f5f4;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .sync-point p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--rtmx-text-muted, #a8a29e);
  }
  .sync-code {
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: #141210;
    border: 1px solid rgba(110, 231, 183, 0.18);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #d6d3d1;
  }
  .sync-selfhost-note {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--rtmx-text-dim, #78716c);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .sync-selfhost-note code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: #a8a29e;
  }
  .sync-client-links {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .sync-client-links a { color: #6ee7b7; }
  .sync-close {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .sync-close > p {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .sync-close .sync-cta-row { margin-top: 1.25rem; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .sync-cta { transition: none; }
    .sync-cta:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
